	;                         SQL Fix ProdLog 35296:  Privilege Error when creating tables/views while SQL Security is disabled
	;  DPV2122 (11/12/2003) - Fix INS/SEL privilege checking
	;  DPV2096 (10/23/2003) - Server-side support for auto-generated keys.
	;  DPV2090 (10/10/2003) - Final elimination of ^mdd from this routine
